# SCOPE
- basket reservation Typescript type
- basket reservation response Typescript type (success only)
- update checkout-queue to check ui request basket reservation type
- sanity cms: add schema basket reservation, must have id
- sanity cms: add groq to add basket reservation based on client basket
- sanity cms: add test products suite (simple) to use for tests / must have every single schema field filled / must be checked and verified
- atomic basket reservation operation: cms receives request, processes it, returns response
- flow: ui request -> skeleton queue fifo pass one -> cms process 1 fully -> cms response -> queue pass response + pop -> ui receive response
- cms process 1 fully: check reservedStock in reservation attempt, check stripePriceId vs client based price (for now happy path only, disprepancies for way later)

# OUT OF SCOPE
- anything other than items mentioned in scope
- any future requirements
- any future concerns
- anything complex
- anything brittle

